<title>USA: Tappan Zee sets stock buy back.</title>
<headline>Tappan Zee sets stock buy back.</headline>
<dateline>TARRYTOWN, N.Y. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tappan Zee Financial Inc said on Thursday it will buy up to 64,800 shares, representing about 4.2 percent of its shares currently outstanding.</p>
<p>Shares to be repurchased will fund restricted stock awards to employees, executives and directors, Tappan Zee said.</p>
</text>
